ocstatusline-bun

This product is a fork of ocstatusline
(https://github.com/amirlehmam/ocstatusline), Copyright (c) 2026 amirlehmam,
distributed under the MIT License. The original MIT license text is kept
verbatim in LICENSE and covers both the original work and this fork.

Changes made in this fork:

  * The build target is a single self-contained binary produced by
    `bun build --compile` for darwin-arm64, darwin-x64, linux-x64 and
    linux-arm64, instead of an npm package built with tsc.
  * The whole build/test/release toolchain is pinned inside one Docker image and
    driven exclusively through docker-compose + Makefile.
  * A fixture-playback mock of the OpenCode SSE server (tests/mock/) removes the
    need for a live `opencode serve` in tests and smoke runs.